{"version":1,"content":"<p>Shopify行政總裁託比·呂特克（Tobi Lütke）就英偉達董事會處理黃仁勳辭職事件的方式發表了尖鋭批評。在周日發佈的一期大衞·森拉（David Senra）播客節目中，呂特克質疑黃仁勳離職前一系列指控出現的先後順序，認為這些事件的安排過於巧合，難以用偶然來解釋。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587594.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:32:42.798651+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:07:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:02.380482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:02.380482+00:00","content_hash":"af5fb39dc04a4a97b0ccbb4b66a733e471715e41bb9f07cb3e29c30b83fa79f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}